{
  "contractId": "KG-LEDGER-QUOTES-v0.1",
  "owner": "develop / KG-PARALLEL-10-WS-27",
  "status": "LOCAL_CANDIDATE_NOT_DEPLOYED",
  "schemaDialect": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "sourceModules": [
    "services/backend/src/ledger.ts",
    "services/backend/src/quotes.ts"
  ],
  "inventoryRule": "operations must equal the routes actually registered by sourceModules (tests/contract/ws27-contracts.test.ts compares against Fastify onRoute).",
  "sharedBehaviors": [
    "All routes respond with Cache-Control: no-store and X-Server-Time (app-level hooks).",
    "authentication=session-active means Authorization: Bearer <access token> that resolves to a live session whose member is not withdrawn; a RESTRICTED member gets 403 ACCOUNT_RESTRICTED.",
    "State transitions are decided by the server. Clients never send status/amount/confirmation flags; unknown properties are rejected with 400 INVALID_REQUEST (additionalProperties:false on every body).",
    "Not a participant => 404 LEDGER_NOT_FOUND so the ledger's existence is not disclosed.",
    "version is optimistic-concurrency state: a stale expectedVersion returns 409 VERSION_CONFLICT.",
    "Quote terms (WS-24): amount is authoritative and the server derives the money fields. vatIncluded=false means amount is the VAT-exclusive supply price (부가세 별도, the default); vatIncluded=true means amount is the final payable total. VAT_RATE is 0.1. priceType is HOURLY or TOTAL (default TOTAL); an HOURLY quote requires hourlyRate and a TOTAL quote must not carry one.",
    "Quote TTL (WS-24): expiresAt is optional. Omitted => now + 7 days. The server rejects an expiry at or before now + 60 seconds (400 INVALID_EXPIRY) and anything beyond now + 30 days (400 EXPIRY_EXCEEDS_MAX_TTL).",
    "Route spelling: every ledger route is plural (/v1/ledgers, /v1/ledgers/:id, /v1/ledgers/:id/notes, /v1/ledgers/:id/quotes). The earlier singular /v1/ledger was unified to plural so the surface carries one spelling."
  ],
  "operations": [
    {
      "id": "ledgerRoles",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/me/roles",
      "authentication": "session-active",
      "source": "services/backend/src/ledger.ts",
      "notes": "roles = USER + EXPERT (when expert_active) + live role_grants role ids, de-duplicated.",
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "roles",
            "grants"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "roles": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "USER",
                  "EXPERT",
                  "CS",
                  "ADMIN"
                ]
              },
              "uniqueItems": true
            },
            "grants": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "role",
                  "startsAt",
                  "endsAt"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "role": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "startsAt": {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/Timestamp"
                  },
                  "endsAt": {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/NullableTimestamp"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "errors": [
        {
          "status": 401,
          "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED",
          "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header"
        },
        {
          "status": 401,
          "code": "SESSION_INVALID",
          "when": "no live session / member withdrawn / member row missing"
        },
        {
          "status": 403,
          "code": "ACCOUNT_RESTRICTED",
          "when": "member has an active restriction"
        }
      ]
    },
