  "openItems": [
    "Quote terms are the user-confirmed WS-24 policy: VAT is quoted separately by default (vatIncluded=false), priceType distinguishes HOURLY from TOTAL, and the TTL is 7 days by default with a 30-day maximum. The server derives supplyAmount/vatAmount/totalAmount from amount; a client-sent derived amount is rejected by additionalProperties:false.",
    "GET /v1/ledgers is expert-only by design; a customer-side ledger list does not exist.",
    "Route spelling is uniform: all ledger routes are plural."
